.vercel

# NOTE: never add a directory under `app/` here. Tailwind v4's automatic source
# detection honours .gitignore, so ignoring `app/app/` silently stopped it
# generating every class used only in app/app/page.tsx (sr-only, gap-8,
# justify-start, z-[70] ...). See app/CLAUDE.md, "Traps".

# Credentials, anywhere in the tree. `app/.gitignore` already covers app/, but a
# key pasted into a root `.env` for a script (the RLS suite reads one) was not
# ignored by anything before this rule. Copies of a credential file are still a
# live credential, so the suffixes are covered too.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem

# Supabase CLI local state (a local Postgres, logs and a generated anon key).
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.env
